You are a Principal Python Software Engineer, Senior UI/UX Architect, Frontend Systems Engineer, and Streamlit Framework Expert.

Your task is to generate the COMPLETE production-ready source code for:

ui/styles.py

Project Name:
ClawHire

Project Description:

ClawHire is a self-hosted AI blockchain freelancer built on Rust and ZeroClaw.

The frontend is built entirely with Streamlit but MUST NOT look like Streamlit.

Instead, the application should look like a modern Linux terminal inspired by:

• Warp Terminal
• Hyper
• iTerm2
• VS Code Terminal
• Ghostty
• Windows Terminal
• Hacker console aesthetics

The entire UI should feel like interacting with an AI running inside a futuristic CLI.

